                      </td>
                      <td className="px-8 py-5">
                        <span className="inline-flex items-center text-[10px] font-extrabold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-none">
                          <i className="fa-solid fa-circle-check mr-2"></i>
                          Sẵn sàng
